{"id":"d182dd0cac33ba74","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-pratt-certificate-correctness.md","title":"递归素性证书的可靠性与完备性","display":"thm-pratt-certificate-correctness — 递归素性证书的可靠性与完备性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-pratt-certificate-correctness","aliases":["73-thm-pratt-certificate-correctness"],"display":"thm-pratt-certificate-correctness — 递归素性证书的可靠性与完备性","depends_on":["[[73-df-pratt-tree-certificate]]","[[73-thm-fermat-and-prime-generator]]","[[73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.5, Theorem 11.26, print pp. 519–521; PDF pp. 541–543; locally repaired induction","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-pratt-certificate-correctness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-pratt-certificate-correctness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pratt-certificate-correctness — 递归素性证书的可靠性与完备性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4723b54e4035a6fb\" href=\"?note=4723b54e4035a6fb\" title=\"73-df-pratt-tree-certificate\">73-df-pratt-tree-certificate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc073a18f449598a\" href=\"?note=cc073a18f449598a\" title=\"73-thm-fermat-and-prime-generator\">73-thm-fermat-and-prime-generator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ff00e4aa0ef74db8\" href=\"?note=ff00e4aa0ef74db8\" title=\"73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion\">73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.5, Theorem 11.26, print pp. 519–521; PDF pp. 541–543; locally repaired induction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrattCert}\">\\(\\operatorname{PrattCert}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}\\)</span> 采用已列依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists c\\;\\operatorname{PrattCert}(c,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists c\\;\\operatorname{PrattCert}(c,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可靠性按有限树高度归纳：孩子已证为素数，乘积穷尽 n−1 的素因子，满阶判据推出当前节点素。完备性对 n 强归纳：n=2 为叶；其他素数取一个满阶元，再把 n−1 的所有素因子递归展开。完备性使用上一条已经补出本地初等证明的满阶元存在结论；原书本身对此只给陈述，笔记补证与原书证据分别记录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pratt-tree-certificate","status":"resolved","id":"4723b54e4035a6fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pratt-tree-certificate]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-fermat-and-prime-generator","status":"resolved","id":"cc073a18f449598a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-fermat-and-prime-generator]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion","status":"resolved","id":"ff00e4aa0ef74db8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PrattCert}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists c\\;\\operatorname{PrattCert}(c,n).","display":true}],"bytes":1530,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-318","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-pratt-certificate-correctness|递归素性证书的可靠性与完备性]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"cfebf3d79d57531c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["4723b54e4035a6fb","cc073a18f449598a","ff00e4aa0ef74db8"]}